  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1525,
      "versionNonce": 1216468329,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "_GxKr-rxZ48MdQ65IaSq3",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 8.216857060569055,
      "y": -2380.33559518627,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "#868e96",
      "width": 946,
      "height": 375,
      "seed": 1891256620,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1673702770579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 19.768521012509073,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "                        AB_lifetime\n\nHiphotetically, let's suppose AB has \"N\" (N=5) Origin&Destiny pairs, \nas following:\n\n        AB = [ OD_1, OD_2, OD_3, OD_4, OD_5 ] \n\n\nFor each OD_i, with \"i\" in {1,...,n} :\n\n    AB_passengers_weight = { OD_1=per1, OD_2=per2, OD_3=per4, OD_4=per4, OD_5=per5 }\n\nwhere, \n\n    OD_i (%) = OD_i_passenger/ Sum {OD_i_passenger}.",
      "baseline": 368,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                        AB_lifetime\n\nHiphotetically, let's suppose AB has \"N\" (N=5) Origin&Destiny pairs, \nas following:\n\n        AB = [ OD_1, OD_2, OD_3, OD_4, OD_5 ] \n\n\nFor each OD_i, with \"i\" in {1,...,n} :\n\n    AB_passengers_weight = { OD_1=per1, OD_2=per2, OD_3=per4, OD_4=per4, OD_5=per5 }\n\nwhere, \n\n    OD_i (%) = OD_i_passenger/ Sum {OD_i_passenger}."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 869,
      "versionNonce": 1497321895,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "XrGsIH9LwbNUQgeMsUwkB",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0.9252554870556651,
      "y": -2783.8425287818554,
      "strokeColor": "#5c940d",
      "backgroundColor": "#868e96",
      "width": 708,
      "height": 375,
      "seed": 129354388,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1673702770579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "And assemble a nested dictionary where each primary key is a segment \n\nand the secondary key an OD where its segments belong, such that:\n\n\nsegments: {OD_!: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_2: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_3: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_4: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_5: [#passenger, time], ... }\n\nThe #passenger information comes from the O/D table provided by \n\"NUMBAT Project\" while time is an output of the shortest path\ncypher.\n ",
      "baseline": 368,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "And assemble a nested dictionary where each primary key is a segment \n\nand the secondary key an OD where its segments belong, such that:\n\n\nsegments: {OD_!: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_2: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_3: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_4: [#passenger, time],\n           OD_5: [#passenger, time], ... }\n\nThe #passenger information comes from the O/D table provided by \n\"NUMBAT Project\" while time is an output of the shortest path\ncypher.\n "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 1515536457,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "pPsbDgHsYm8qVxp7oh5Yw",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 8.425255487055665,
      "y": -3376.3425287818554,
      "strokeColor": "#5c940d",
      "backgroundColor": "#868e96",
      "width": 682,
      "height": 75,
      "seed": 1630569900,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1673702770579,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Using the shortest path algorithm, we can get all segments, \nconcerning the least travel time, for each OD in the \"NUMBAT \nProject\" table. From that, it is possible to transverse the segments",
      "baseline": 68,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Using the shortest path algorithm, we can get all segments, \nconcerning the least travel time, for each OD in the \"NUMBAT \nProject\" table. From that, it is possible to transverse the segments"
    },
