    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1685,
      "versionNonce": 1817089735,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "IKdB_yHhhyv37r-S_-P5c",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 0.6683218914699864,
      "y": -1551.4110836198724,
      "strokeColor": "#a61e4d",
      "backgroundColor": "#868e96",
      "width": 1010,
      "height": 375,
      "seed": 112242964,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1673702770581,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "After disruption, similarly:\n\n    AB_time' = { OD_1=time_1', OD_2=time_2', OD_3=time_3', OD_4=time_4', OD_5=time_5' }\n\nwhere, \n\n    time_i' = shortest time path for OD after AB disruption\n\nand, \n\n    AB_weigthed_time' = time_1'*per1 + time_2'*per2 + time_3'*per3 + time_4'*per4 + time_5'*per5\n\n\nwhere \"AB_weigthed_time'\" represents the weighted sum of travel time of every passenger under AB \ndisruption. ",
      "baseline": 368,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After disruption, similarly:\n\n    AB_time' = { OD_1=time_1', OD_2=time_2', OD_3=time_3', OD_4=time_4', OD_5=time_5' }\n\nwhere, \n\n    time_i' = shortest time path for OD after AB disruption\n\nand, \n\n    AB_weigthed_time' = time_1'*per1 + time_2'*per2 + time_3'*per3 + time_4'*per4 + time_5'*per5\n\n\nwhere \"AB_weigthed_time'\" represents the weighted sum of travel time of every passenger under AB \ndisruption. "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1819,
      "versionNonce": 916479273,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "TPQH6d5Crez95k2wbCt38",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": -14.78172150396557,
      "y": -1113.5547363325725,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "#868e96",
      "width": 688,
      "height": 286,
      "seed": 1655854892,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1673702770581,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20.777777777777782,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "                        Lifetime Distress\n\nOne can simplify the a segment lifetime stress as:\n\n    AB_time_distress = (AB_weigthed_time' - AB_weigthed_time)\n\n\n    AB_lifetime_distress = AB_time_distress * AB_passengers \n\n\n",
      "baseline": 278,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                        Lifetime Distress\n\nOne can simplify the a segment lifetime stress as:\n\n    AB_time_distress = (AB_weigthed_time' - AB_weigthed_time)\n\n\n    AB_lifetime_distress = AB_time_distress * AB_passengers \n\n\n"
    },
