      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20.777777777777782,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Then, we calculate the shortes time for each OD in AB\n\n    AB_time = { OD_1=time_1, OD_2=time_2, OD_3=time_3, OD_4=time_4, OD_5=time_5 }\n\nwhere, \n\n    time_i = shortest time path for OD\n\nand, \n\n    AB_weigthed_time =  time_1*per1 + time_2*per2 + time_3*per3 + time_4*per4 + time_5*per5\n\nwhere \"AB_weigthed_time\" represents the weighted sum of travel time of \nevery passenger using the segment AB. ",
      "baseline": 356,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Then, we calculate the shortes time for each OD in AB\n\n    AB_time = { OD_1=time_1, OD_2=time_2, OD_3=time_3, OD_4=time_4, OD_5=time_5 }\n\nwhere, \n\n    time_i = shortest time path for OD\n\nand, \n\n    AB_weigthed_time =  time_1*per1 + time_2*per2 + time_3*per3 + time_4*per4 + time_5*per5\n\nwhere \"AB_weigthed_time\" represents the weighted sum of travel time of \nevery passenger using the segment AB. "
    },
